<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 33.87 to 6850.03.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.23 to 412.80, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.13.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1301 to 1186.</p>
<p>Volume was 585,720,720 compared with 571,264,770 Tuesday.</p>
